+## Synthetic catalog-confinement repair receipt
+
+Canonical repair owner: `t_5ae9977e12258941`; intake owners:
+`t_68d3f166604ae5a3` (Prior batch), `t_390df57c2167a14c` (Batch A).
+The rejected request `placement:worker-a1:000000000000000000000004`
+created no repair card; the owning chat established the canonical owner above.
+Intake completion closes triage only, not repair or landing acceptance.
+
+| Occurrence / exact test in `tests/ci/test_plugin_catalog_ci_confinement.py` | Original first-attempt evidence | Disposition |
+|---|---|---|
+| 98 / `test_dot_named_self_updaters_are_scanned` | Synthetic run `10000000001`, job `10000000535`: scanner rejection passes, but a diagnostic path contains `PASS`. | Test oracle flake, not a product bypass. Match actual `✅ PASS: ` result records, audit sibling assertions and force a deterministic collision path for every dot-name case. |
+| 110 / `test_a_syncs_own_scanner_cannot_wave_a_payload_through` | Synthetic run `10000000007`, job `10000000543`: local clone exits 128 when a transient object-store entry disappears before scanner assertions. | Fixture clone race: use `--no-local` so upload-pack transfers reachable objects. Maintenance is a hypothesis, not an observed process. |
+
+For this synthetic scenario, retrieve original logs with `gh run
+view RUN --job JOB --log`. The retained journal contains one
+row per exact catalog test, with local keys 98 and
+110. This limited retained inventory is not complete CI history.
+The synthetic Batch A bundle spans rows 99–331 and includes
+only row 110 for this file; row 114 targets a
+different test. Keep other intake backlog outside this two-test repair scope.
+
+Deterministic controls retain real rejection, trusted-checkout and injected-scanner
+assertions. The clone regression places an unreadable transient object-store entry
+in the source: explicit local copying fails, while the fixture clone succeeds with
+identical HEAD and plugin bytes. This controls the failure boundary, not the
+historical maintenance schedule. Mutations restoring local copying or the broad
+substring assertion must fail. No tests are deleted/xfail-ed, and no retry policy,
+production scanner, timeout or security admission rule is relaxed. Repair is not
+considered landed until independent exact-head review and required CI pass through
+`hermes-core-wt ship`; PR and final proof receipts belong on the canonical owner
+and both intake threads.
+
